{"about_the_game":"Rabbidom is a centennial kingdom that has witnessed more and more curious things in its ups and downs. Therefore, Corenemo the rabbit decides to set off on a journey, looking for a treasure told in ancient stories, the Apple, which has a connection to whatever is happening in the kingdom. Now, you will help Corenemo find out the truth.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/bfa10ca5af69cacac53d44c4b9b7f18d.avif?t=1770288346\" width=627 height=357 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/2726c7f088af23f5425d32f2bc322576.webp?t=1770288346\" width=609 height=55 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling Combat</h2>Agile little rabbit Corenemo is a master of diverse combat moves, allowing you to tackle various challenges based on conditions. Feel the flow of combat and use abilities or moves at the right time to defeat formidable enemies. The sense of accomplishment and excitement of the combat  won't upset you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/5ffffa11559e8acafa60e4ef1e396c64.poster.avif?t=1770288346\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/5ffffa11559e8acafa60e4ef1e396c64.webm?t=1770288346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/2726c7f088af23f5425d32f2bc322576.webp?t=1770288346\" width=609 height=55 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy but Deep Character Building System</h2>Alter the effect of your weapons using Beads, an innovative system for you to build your own combat style with different combinations of Beads. Putting them together is enough to leverage their power... However, your weapons will benefit from placements showing your unique understanding! Find the Bead Manuals for placement references. Your luck will bring you to some rare manuals offering special effects!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/59a4d561a374c58e4f40b3480a4e6bea.avif?t=1770288346\" width=627 height=357 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/2726c7f088af23f5425d32f2bc322576.webp?t=1770288346\" width=609 height=55 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Various Friends and Foes</h2>You will encounter many characters on this continent. Some might be your foes, while others are allies. Help or kill them, and you won't go unrewarded. This is not only about finishing quests but also about growth and precious experiences in this adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/68bc4c7f927f7d7bccdf14f321e148bd.poster.avif?t=1770288346\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/68bc4c7f927f7d7bccdf14f321e148bd.webm?t=1770288346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/2726c7f088af23f5425d32f2bc322576.webp?t=1770288346\" width=609 height=55 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2965130?t=1770288346","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770288346","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/40ac2fbaa208510c45a09320b3292983ada88b55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770288346","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/40ac2fbaa208510c45a09320b3292983ada88b55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770288346","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Rabbidom is a centennial kingdom that has witnessed more and more curious things in its ups and downs. Therefore, Corenemo the rabbit decides to set off on a journey, looking for a treasure told in ancient stories, the Apple, which has a connection to whatever is happening in the kingdom. Now, you will help Corenemo find out the truth.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/bfa10ca5af69cacac53d44c4b9b7f18d.avif?t=1770288346\" width=627 height=357 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/2726c7f088af23f5425d32f2bc322576.webp?t=1770288346\" width=609 height=55 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling Combat</h2>Agile little rabbit Corenemo is a master of diverse combat moves, allowing you to tackle various challenges based on conditions. Feel the flow of combat and use abilities or moves at the right time to defeat formidable enemies. The sense of accomplishment and excitement of the combat  won't upset you!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/5ffffa11559e8acafa60e4ef1e396c64.poster.avif?t=1770288346\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/5ffffa11559e8acafa60e4ef1e396c64.webm?t=1770288346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/2726c7f088af23f5425d32f2bc322576.webp?t=1770288346\" width=609 height=55 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy but Deep Character Building System</h2>Alter the effect of your weapons using Beads, an innovative system for you to build your own combat style with different combinations of Beads. Putting them together is enough to leverage their power... However, your weapons will benefit from placements showing your unique understanding! Find the Bead Manuals for placement references. Your luck will bring you to some rare manuals offering special effects!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/59a4d561a374c58e4f40b3480a4e6bea.avif?t=1770288346\" width=627 height=357 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/2726c7f088af23f5425d32f2bc322576.webp?t=1770288346\" width=609 height=55 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Various Friends and Foes</h2>You will encounter many characters on this continent. Some might be your foes, while others are allies. Help or kill them, and you won't go unrewarded. This is not only about finishing quests but also about growth and precious experiences in this adventure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2965130/extras/68bc4c7f927f7d7bccdf14f321e148bd.poster.avif?t=1770288346\" width=616 height=347 ><so